                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a58bf44b-d639-33cb-acb2-d5bf1acbeec5",
                        "entry_id": "b4dbaab0-7895-3114-8fe0-97332de80b20",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Initialiser en programmation, à partir d'un espace mémoire réservé, un objet à partir d'un ensemble de caractéristiques, appelé « classe »."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Programmation orientée objet"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5bdab7a8-4871-3d15-b425-d6f8646ea7fb",
                        "entry_id": "b4dbaab0-7895-3114-8fe0-97332de80b20",
                        "glosses": [
                            "De manière plus générale, fabriquer un exemplaire d'un élément à partir d'un modèle qui lui sert en quelque sorte de moule. Dans le cas d'un patron (template en anglais), la fabrication requiert un paramétrage, c'est-à-dire une fixation des valeurs des paramètres inclus dans le patron."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a240dad4-aea0-4bf1-993c-13b9fa379f91",
                        "source_entry_id": "b4dbaab0-7895-3114-8fe0-97332de80b20",
                        "source_sense_id": "a58bf44b-d639-33cb-acb2-d5bf1acbeec5",
                        "target_lang_word": "instantiate",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "instantiate",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b9c75716-95bf-3a7f-bfac-4d4a1c724931",
                                        "entry_id": "56600205-80b0-3cd1-811c-a7f084e63c6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To represent (a concept, theme, or principle) by an instance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9a2a07fa-94be-4cb1-b842-7dc49431dcb2",
                                                "sense_id": "b9c75716-95bf-3a7f-bfac-4d4a1c724931",
                                                "text": "To see and test the result of one's CSS for any particular HTML element, one must instantiate that element in a document."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c39238a8-aba2-49a3-817a-c9d1575ca61a",
                                                "sense_id": "b9c75716-95bf-3a7f-bfac-4d4a1c724931",
                                                "text": "In the eighteenth century, this was instantiated in writings which developed the view that ‘savages’ exhibited more virtue and moral nobility than their conquerors."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "76476285-9de5-3667-8028-a3fc4e0e3411",
                                        "entry_id": "56600205-80b0-3cd1-811c-a7f084e63c6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To create an object (an instance) of a specific class."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a54adf81-2c8f-4779-b331-189c9fd39856",
                                                "sense_id": "76476285-9de5-3667-8028-a3fc4e0e3411",
                                                "text": "To instantiate a class, we call its constructor."
                                            }
                                        ]
